# Video Post Studio

Read `skills/video-post-studio/SKILL.md` in full before using it.

Quick reference:
- Setup once: `bash skills/creative-studio/scripts/bootstrap.sh`; prove it: `bash skills/video-post-studio/scripts/selftest.sh`.
- Call: `bash skills/video-post-studio/scripts/call.sh <tool> '<json>'` (or `@args.json`; `help <tool>`).
- Gates: brief → ingest/log (`video_probe`, `video_scene_detect`, `video_select_takes`, `video_transcript`) → paper edit (`video_transcript_edit`) → rough cut (`video_edit` / `video_cut_to_beats` / `video_auto_edit`) → fine cut → colour → sound → captions → `video_qc` → `video_export` + `stock_credits` + `video_export_interchange`.
- LOOK at every preview (shot sheets, storyboard, contact sheet, Kdenlive check, QC table). Never deliver with a QC FAIL.
- Stock b-roll: no identifiable people or other brands' logos in ads (auto-edit rejects faces by default); licences credited.
- Revisions go into the timeline JSON and re-render — never patch the MP4.
